WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.560
Three years ago, I made a little 30-day practice called Glimmers and Gratitude.

00:04.560 --> 00:07.280
It's still one of my favorite journals to flip through.

00:07.280 --> 00:11.760
In the busyness of our everyday lives, we often overlook the small moments

00:11.760 --> 00:13.680
and blessings around us.

00:13.680 --> 00:17.040
I find myself more aware and fully present

00:17.040 --> 00:20.960
to the gifts that surround me even on the most ordinary of days.

00:21.520 --> 00:24.160
It is one prompt a day for November.

00:24.160 --> 00:27.120
10 minutes, a journal, whatever supplies you have.

00:27.120 --> 00:29.920
Some days you write, some days you decorate a page.

00:29.920 --> 00:32.880
By the end of November, you have 30 little pages.

00:32.880 --> 00:35.600
They add up to a month where you actually paused,

00:35.600 --> 00:39.040
played with your supplies, and noticed the glimmers all around you.

00:39.040 --> 00:42.960
I went back through all 30 prompts this fall and freshened them up,

00:42.960 --> 00:48.320
and I'm doing a few of them again on camera so you can see what mine look like now.

00:48.320 --> 00:50.000
It starts November 1st.

00:50.000 --> 00:53.120
If you're just joining for the first time, it's $45.

00:53.120 --> 00:54.000
The link is right here.
